span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guard the previous attack and dash or jump within the warning area to counter at the same time as dodging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298710/extras/b13f4c94d845f20ffda87f421c518b8b.avif?t=1788146476\" width=780 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298710/extras/40c6102d580fc2fce83616d29af72786.poster.avif?t=1788146476\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298710/extras/40c6102d580fc2fce83616d29af72786.webm?t=1788146476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298710/extras/40c6102d580fc2fce83616d29af72786.mp4?t=1788146476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow with multiple equipment that changes the combat experience beyond simple numerical changes, such as artifacts that have different effects depending on the direction of mounting or alchemy that gives additional effects when using an elixir.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298710/extras/af14b76d649d05b25c89376fa9cdb74b.avif?t=1788146476\" width=780 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298710/extras/f5683c15d0e6d3b2b5f59589dc5ffeb6.poster.avif?t=1788146476\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298710/ex